---
description: Announce long-running task completions via TTS
alwaysApply: false
globs: "**/*.{rs,ts,js,py,go,sh}"
---

When you run a command that will take more than 10 seconds to complete (builds, tests, deploys, batch processing), use TTS to announce completion:

```
crustytts --say "Build complete."
```

For long-running operations, also consider announcing major milestones:

```
crustytts --say "All tests passed."
crustytts --say "Deployment finished successfully."
```
